   "note": "drawing - sheet 2 gives BLACK (RAL 9005) for the plain part number P32E06M, drawn here as the RAL's #0e0e10 on the body. THE PLATE, MOULDING, SCREW AND LAMP-WINDOW COLOURS ARE NOT CHECKED against any source; no photograph is held."
